  <item>
    <title>VOL.41HEA游广州之北京路 （先导）篇 | 你的童年我的青春都在这里了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/654cf82451ba7218579b9167</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">654cf82451ba7218579b9167</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Nov 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天广州系列开更啦，终于迎来了名声在外的北京路。拥有如此厚重历史的地方，估计会说三集，今天这集就轻松一点聊聊大家对这条路的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 这个系列续更压力都在Nicole这里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 每周末都去北京路，逛些什么啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 北京路曾经也是潮流街</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 曾经的玩街，现在的古道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 回忆杀：动漫星城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> “越富广场”靓仔靓妹爱逛的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 回忆杀：滑旱冰</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>北京路大众点评（个人版）</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 回忆杀：广州最早的西餐——仙踪林、绿茵阁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 流动烧烤摊【风筒辉】 、【陕西大厦】里的地道陕西美食、【太平馆】西餐厅、超正宗香脆煲仔饭【超记】、一鱼多吃的顺德菜【顺得来】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>我和北京路的故事</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> 当日本朋友要去逛北京路的时候，我还是认真做了些功课的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 去北京路对于我来说等于“回娘家了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> &nbsp;超糗的约会经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：东山少爷《北京路情缘》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvB2IBGFBeMZ0Lpc5kukh0AfUnvK.m4a" length="82188073" type="audio/mp4"/>
