    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.38乐夏3：聊啥音乐啊，就聊综艺好了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65281c570432a315784cc66a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65281c570432a315784cc66a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Oct 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>既然co姐不在，我和33就聊聊她不在可以聊的话题吧。本期围绕我和33都喜欢的综艺节目《乐队的夏天3》聊聊我们的感受。如果你也看乐夏3，不妨也在评论区跟我们一起聊起来。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 中秋国庆大长假：有人去泉州看寺庙，有人在杭州踩单车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 错过了报复co姐的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 作为乐夏老观众，觉得这个IP有点“疲”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 乐夏能增加我的歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> &nbsp;音乐高低好坏之分，我很好奇节目如何在一套保准逻辑下评出所谓的“好乐队”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 大张伟真的为乐夏拉了不少好感度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1376">22:56</a> 聊啥音乐啊，就聊综艺好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 周迅不会点评能不能少上点综艺啊，好好去演戏吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 嘉宾里面也就剩下张亚东会少一些刺耳的话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 友友们都变成夸夸群了，开始没意思了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 马东还会挑事儿，这个希望继续保持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 乐队们的性格不够以前鲜明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> “情怀”搞多了，真的也会腻的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 我内心的hot5 乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 分享一下播到目前为止最爱的歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 来，给乐夏3打个分吧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期BGM</span></strong><span>：</span><br><span>新学校废物合唱团《干杯时我会想起你》、八仙饭店《吞吐》、安达《江格尔十二英雄赞》、Nova Heart《my song 9》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loR9jBFHeMlXCx_WUTYdEjrBHe9H.m4a" length="54939214" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpNmRjSjQyb2RsSldiSnYzTkUzTkk2OTVIYjIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.37 【中秋国庆SP】30+的你，敢抛下一切去新的城市工作吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6514f44b0432a31578a70118</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6514f44b0432a31578a70118</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Sep 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔一个月，我们三个又回来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近三个人都面临了比较大的生活变动，有关于工作的，也有关于健康的。本期没有特地的主题，就是简单地跟大家分享三个人最近的经历。未来或许可以启动【双城CITY WALK】计划了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> NANA在35岁毅然决定走出舒适圈，换个城市工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 33辞去薪酬福利优越的大厂工作，创业寻找梦想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 留守广州的Nicole，不知道该不该从乙方跳去甲方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 朋克养生多年的Nicole终于迷途知返</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> NANA、33分享换了个城市工作的个人感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3376">56:16</a> 三个人分享中秋国庆长假计划</span></p><span></span><p><span>​</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家也有同样的换工作疑惑或想法，可以在评论里跟我们分享讨论哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：Taylor Swift《Wildest Dreams》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpcD97PVg1iu94ZWfJA4qJFr-722.m4a" length="64507462" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtU1FCVFRLTnNWS2RWZVNTejZxc1ktbnJCeGYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.36 HEA游广州之永庆坊篇 | 全世界可能只有这里，可以边学咏春边叹咖啡 part2</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f0a1893fa4090b74ce1f45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f0a1893fa4090b74ce1f45</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Aug 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期继续是我们《hea游广州》（漫游广州）人文系列内容，谢谢大家对于我们永庆坊上集的喜欢~~上一次我们是讲了荔枝湾片区的景点，这期终于来到大家都在人挤人的恩宁路和永庆坊。大家继续跟着我们的声音逛逛吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 原来“建新如故”的永庆坊也有点故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 不管看没看过“粤剧”都值得一去的粤剧博物馆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhnQNrR0Eu95whStqon9SDDZWRov.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（粤剧博物馆的外观）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> &nbsp;33逛博物馆的时候，被两件非常特别的藏品吸引到</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUM_mqN6ubofhJFerpaV6fSn2iK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（绿色胶片男蟒）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQ9TnVh-KnWVuQ4Ha7havwB2hZ_.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（蝴蝶形扬琴图）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 粤剧艺人也有他们的快乐之家【八和会馆】汪阿姐从92年就开始做主席</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjue1OIBRDnZGn-S71unDtVX8LUa.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">27:34</a> 粤剧人原来也有自己信奉的祖师爷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvVHaIyIMld5ez0wmRT_3XE7rjUw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（粤剧华光祖师巡游图）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> 没想到李小龙的爸爸原来以前是唱戏的，果然是戏武世家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FugNFE6KsAM1nJoZ3e1fHqHTO--Q.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2616">43:36</a> 还有其他文物保护单位值得大家探索：詹天佑故居、泰华楼、宝庆大押</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2901">48:21</a> 讲完历史就开始挖掘网红打卡店：适合文艺爱猫人士的书店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr2SGotZ5nHg3PQuXuWzskSrVX-F.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（钟书阁）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0e2PiMVMjJF-MX9LnjRPLxPzCC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（岭南镬耳屋设计）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 每个有live的晚上，MAO的天花板都摇摇欲坠，33在这里看过与非门、时至夏末、邓永鹏等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 逛完听完，就要去广州有名的老字号小吃集中营：永庆食集</span></p><span></span><p><span>里面有陈添记、阿婆牛杂、银记肠粉、八珍煎饺、开记甜品、鸳鸯王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">54:50</a> 原来恩宁路也是广州年轻人创业聚集地，有各类的新式咖啡/甜品</span></p><span></span><p><span>西关祖屋风情【恩宁公啡】、巷子里的手冲咖啡【SSAW四序咖啡】</span></p><span></span><p><span>美好的戚风蛋糕店【之山之季】、广州的可露丽标杆之一【Locker Room】</span></p><span></span><p><span>新式传统甜品店【街尾食糖】、创新口味蛋挞【功夫蛋挞】</span></p><span></span><p><span>花椒/姜撞奶味雪糕【恩宁雪糕行】、蒸笼雪糕【Also Cab】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：何乾樑/homeboy叶枫华《骑楼街》</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大家对广州还有什么想景点想了解的，记得留言，我们尽量满足(*❦ω❦)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpf8dZGnXt-TQyZ2IHK8qWAVK4RF.m4a" length="61275494" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwUEh4S0VGZjdKQ0xOQWdEemlaMU93WW5kUEwucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.35 HEA游广州之永庆坊篇 | 挤都挤不进去，究竟在逛什么啊？part1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e72b763fa4090b7426d3e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e72b763fa4090b7426d3e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Aug 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期又迎来《hea游广州》（漫游广州）人文系列内容，还是集中在西关老城区。果然老广州片区怎么逛都逛不完，这一次打卡新晋网红景点“永庆坊”，人多到爆棚，我们逛出了春运的感觉。一起跟着我们的声音逛逛吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 新旧文化碰撞的示范景区：永庆坊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 西关永庆坊街区涵盖范围：北部荔枝湾片区，南部恩宁路多宝路片区（详细见下图）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpOGPvtC1azTNl9KDOHok7CqoenH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 小红书爆火的“月亮桥”推动永庆坊出圈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk8lbM4ReMSYd_JhgynzWrybgA84.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 荔湾湖公园+荔枝湾涌：一湖一涌，步步皆景</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 坐落于荔湾湖公园内的老西关风情手冲咖啡店「原本工坊」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 千年古村：“泮塘五约”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 藏在古村落深巷的情调咖啡馆「绿至·时间小院」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> 近千年的古道庙「仁威祖庙」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> &nbsp;学业祈福：文塔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 起义路的梁氏祖祠“千乘侯祠：梁家祠”</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————泮塘路美食————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> </span><u><strong><span>泮溪酒家：荔湾湖畔的岭南园林特色粤菜酒家</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> </span><u><strong><span>向群饭店：三十年老广家常味，连续入选广州米其林指南</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> </span><u><strong><span>开记甜品：代表西关风味的糖水老店</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a> </span><u><strong><span>西关特色濑粉店：凌记、省城濑粉</span></strong></u></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOTVNPf0dgOs_QzFt0a_ah26hq-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期BGM：何乾樑/homeboy叶枫华《骑楼街》</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于永庆坊大家还有什么想推荐的，记得留言，我们热情期待(*❦ω❦)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnft5oBwFQbCYJILkJpBuXEynuJM.m4a" length="43849316" type="audio/mp4"/>
